# TRENCHING SIMULATOR's Live mode (2026-10-21, #404): live.agi1.app in front of the relay, with automatic HTTPS (Caddy
# gets its certificate and renews it by itself, once the DNS record live → this server is there and ports 80 and 443 are
# open). WebSockets (/ws) pass straight through. relay.sh start runs it (the official Caddy image). No access log: a
# viewer's address is never written down.
live.agi1.app {
	encode zstd gzip
	header {
		-Server
		Strict-Transport-Security "max-age=31536000"
		X-Content-Type-Options nosniff
		Referrer-Policy no-referrer
	}
	reverse_proxy agi1-trench:8787
}
